# What `specify extension add` copies from this repository (Spec Kit reads this file with gitignore syntax and never copies it).
# An allow-list: every root entry is excluded, then the extension's own files are taken back in. Tests, the CLI source, the
# virtualenv, internal notes, scripts and local secrets never reach an installed project.
/*
!/extension.yml
!/commands/
!/rules/
!/workflows/
!/LICENSE
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
